    <nav class="ef-wrap ef-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/services/">Services</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page">Trade show lead follow-up</span></nav>
    <section class="ef-wrap ef-hero" aria-labelledby="ef-title">
      <div><p class="ef-eyebrow">Trade show lead follow-up services</p><h1 id="ef-title">Turn your trade-show conversations into <span>qualified sales meetings.</span></h1><p class="ef-lead">You invested in the event. Put a team behind what happens next. CallTeam calls your contacts, follows up on their requests and prepares the right conversations for your salespeople.</p><div class="ef-actions"><a class="ef-button ef-button-solid" href="https://calendly.com/hello-callteam/new-meeting" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Plan Your Event Follow-Up <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="ef-text-link" href="#ef-two-weeks">See the two-week example <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><p class="ef-byline">Written by <a href="{{ authors.harjSingh.url }}" rel="author">{{ authors.harjSingh.name }}</a> · <time datetime="2026-10-19">October 19, 2026</time></p></div>
      <aside class="ef-event-sheet" aria-label="Three different starting points in an event follow-up list"><div class="ef-sheet-top"><span>After the event</span><span>Example worklist</span></div><h2>Your list has<br>different next steps.</h2><ol><li><span>01</span><div><strong>“Show me how it works.”</strong><p>Confirm the requested demo.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>“We should speak again.”</strong><p>Reconnect around the discussion.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>A scan, with few notes.</strong><p>Check relevance and interest.</p></div></li></ol><p class="ef-sheet-bottom">Every open record needs<br><strong>an owner and a next action.</strong></p></aside>
    </section>
    <div class="ef-wrap ef-scope-line"><strong>A focused campaign for recent event contacts.</strong><p>Trade shows, conferences and agreed webinar or virtual-event lists. Human calling, structured follow-up, qualification, booking and CRM handoff.</p></div>
